      "content": "It's a very common feeling, that crushing weight of realizing your grand ambitions are just... average. Don't mistake \"okay\" for \"meaningless\"; sometimes the most profound satisfaction comes from the quiet, consistent act of just *being* and doing. You don't need a massive destiny to have a valuable, real life.",
